   Recheck Cond: ((a = ANY ('{182,183,306}'::integer[])) AND (b = ANY ('{1,2}'::integer[])))
   Heap Blocks: exact=2
   Buffers: shared hit=7
   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on multi_test_idx  (cost=0.00..2.31 rows=3 width=0) (actual rows=3 loops=1)
