  and two > 0
  and twenty in (1, 2, 5, 7, 8, 11, 12, 13, 14, 17)
  and hundred in (1, 3, 4, 9, 14, 51, 90, 88, 41, 39, 22)
group by
  two, four, twenty, hundred
order by
